121	<h1>Held rule drafts, version 31</h1>
122	<p class="standfirst">Version 31. Eleven landed changes wait for the curator&rsquo;s reading: items 80 to 85, the passages where the landing of drafts 43 to 65 changed the approved words; and items 86 to 90, when the coordinator writes the boot note. Two proposed changes wait for the curator&rsquo;s yes, in ten drafts, 70 to 79: a question has one home; and each line of the held list names its exit.</p>
123	</header>
