148	<h2>Landed since the curator&rsquo;s last approval</h2>
149	<p>Eleven items, not yet read, oldest first. The curator read items 41 and 42 at 22:23 UTC on 23 November 2026, so they went. At 00:1x UTC on 24 November the curator approved drafts 43 to 65, with the changes that he approved on their threads that evening, and they landed in one commit at 00:13 UTC. The words that he approved get no item. Each item below shows a passage whose landed words differ from them, against the approved words. In five passages, the approved words named the landing report or the gather record, both withdrawn on the drafts&rsquo; threads before the landing, at the curator&rsquo;s objection; the coordinator and the skill writer changed each by the fewest words. In one, a word changed for the skills&rsquo; lint. Items 86 to 90 are the five passages of one later change of 24 November: when the coordinator writes the boot note.</p>
