173	<div class="change solo"><div><span class="side">Landed text, against the approved words of draft 49; struck through, the approved words that went; underlined, the words that came in. In the skill&rsquo;s words, &ldquo;you&rdquo; is the coordinator.</span>
174	<p class="where-in">SKILL.md, &ldquo;The curator&rsquo;s role and decisions&rdquo;, the bullet on changes that wait for the curator&rsquo;s yes, its first sentence, line 126</p>
175	<ul><li>A change that touches the curator's role and decisions (this section), the asks, the held list, the review queue, the <span class="cut">landing report</span><span class="add">landing's one line for each decision</span> or the register in which you write to the curator (the bullets at the head of "Talking to the curator") waits for the curator's yes to its exact words.</li></ul>
