192	<p class="where-in">references/batch.md, &ldquo;The roles&rdquo;, the third bullet, its sentences on a reserved point and a file outside the rung&rsquo;s section, line 55</p>
193	<p>Reaching a reserved point, or a file outside what the rung's section of the batch record names, does not make a settled fix contested: it lands. The point goes where "Reserved points and repairs" says, and the <span class="cut">gather record</span><span class="add">post-batch review's section "For the curator"</span> lists the file.</p>
